## v0.7.5 – Signup Page Redesign with Info Panels

**Date:** December 25, 2024

### Changes Made:
- Redesigned signup page with two-column layout (form + info panels)
- Added disabled button state: grey100 fill, grey200 stroke, shadow-grey, grey400 text
- Button stays disabled until all fields (nickname, email, password) and checkbox are filled
- Added ASTROTASK logomark (40px) with version number, links to root page
- Added "WELCOME TO THE ALPHA" tagline below logomark (18px, grey500, uppercase)
- Changed name field placeholder from "Name" to "Nickname"
- Changed signup title to 20px bold
- Created info column 200px to the right of signup form
- Added Alpha warning box (red theme): explains alpha state, potential data resets, pro tier promise
- Added Zero Knowledge Encryption info box (grey theme): lists what's encrypted vs not
- Styled bullet list for encrypted items (column titles, task titles, projects, tags)
- Added italic paragraph with bold "not" emphasizing what data is NOT encrypted
- Fixed REQUIRE_INVITE missing from local .env (was only in docker-compose)

### Current Status:
- Signup page has full two-column layout with informative panels
- Invite-only signup now enforced in local development
- All styling matches design system (Berkeley Mono, KKAN palette, semicondensed variants)

